---
title: "Statistics I"
code: "MTH-245"
category: "mathematics"
credits: "3"
prerequisites:
  - "2026/MTH-154"
  - "2026/MTH-161"
corequisites: []
prerequisiteNote: "Prerequisite: Completion of MTH 154 or MTH 161 or equivalent with a grade of C or better."
---

Presents an overview of statistics, including descriptive statistics, elementary probability, probability distributions, estimation, hypothesis testing, correlation, and linear regression. Credit will not be awarded for both MTH 155: Statistical Reasoning and MTH 245: Statistics I or equivalent. This is a Passport Transfer course. Lecture 3 hours. Total 3 hours per week.
